  "rulings": {
    "references": [
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT14-081#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT14-081 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Normally, the turn will end and switch when the memory moves to 1 or more on your opponent's side. But while this effect is activated, the turn won't end unless the memory moves to 3 or more on your opponent's side. Your turn will continue when your opponent's memory is at 1 or 2.",
        "question": "What does this card's [Your Turn] effect mean?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, this effect only applies during your turn. Your opponent's turn continues until the memory moves to 1 or more from your perspective.",
        "question": "If the memory moves to 2 or less on my opponent's side during my opponent's turn, does the turn switch to my turn with this card's [Your Turn] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, your turn continues.",
        "question": "The memory moved to 3 or more on my opponent's side and the turn ended while this card's [Your Turn] effect was activated. If the memory moves to 1 or 2 on my opponent's side due to an [End of Your Turn] effect, does my turn continue?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No. ＜Blitz＞ still requires the memory to be at 1 or more on your opponent's side for attacking.",
        "question": "When the memory moves to 3 or more on my opponent's side while this card's [Your Turn] effect is activated, does ＜Blitz＞ allow for attacking?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't. This effect is a \"You may play\" effect, but it doesn't include \"up to,\" therefore you must choose to either play no cards or as many as possible.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [When Digivolving] effect to play just 2 of the target cards from my trash when [Eiji Nagasumi] is in this Digimon's digivolution cards and I have 3 or more level 4 or lower cards with the [Dark Animal] or [SoC] trait in my trash?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "The memory will move to 3 on your opponent's side, and the turn will end if there are no other effects pending activation, etc.",
        "question": "What happens if I declare a \"pass\" when I have this Digimon?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
